ield/validate]} {:db/id "q-104478" :question/id #uuid "30520f93-e92c-5fa8-bb5e-0a9ccde3033e" :question/math-academy-id "q-104478" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14005293/assets/8d940d158c631143a1fe7652a4fb83bf2f67f3fd4bbdbbc4a33643bd282b5028.png)\n\nThe Argand diagram above shows the roots of the cubic polynomial $f(x).$ Find $f(x)$ given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $4.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=0$ and ${x}_{2,3}=-1\\pm 2\\text{i}.$ Additionally, we're given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=4.$ Therefore, we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =4(x-0)(x-(-1+2\\text{i}))(x-(-1-2\\text{i})) \\\\  & =4x(x-(-1+2\\text{i}))(x-(-1-2\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x(x-(-1+2\\text{i}))(x-(-1-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 4x({x}^{2}-x(-1-2\\text{i})-x(-1+2\\text{i})+(-1+2\\text{i})(-1-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 4x({x}^{2}+2x+5) & = \\\\ 4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+20x & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+20x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-104478/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4bb90c5-2794-5657-8f0b-45eb64873e03"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104478"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection/f73b2dabd2a3493308c1df0303d9039de7c4c3b3dfd412ef871afe24587f2cef" :answer/id #uuid "462ac7b0-1ecb-531e-9bcf-db07cc13beae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-16x-35" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection/7c59a78bcab05f0345ebbca095f5b0be1f45a6f55c128e4d5a1bb30a12af68ff" :answer/id #uuid "a7de367a-7e35-5907-8632-6d394448c9cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-16x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection/2f6bf6798f27657f7aef55909c60f7e59acc90199a1156fcfc38aa621bbfd54e" :answer/id #uuid "27e78b09-c56d-5859-b1a3-a04022b0e24d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+32x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection/c77dc21d0b0a32e075674c8f303b541f7a8438473cc3455e0b76637083282f6b" :answer/id #uuid "5bc08d13-1fc6-5d2b-a481-c867d35e6ceb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-32x-40" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection/704533e564147e83ceecd0d69d35fa34a74ab05449b2fd45375643ef26b027b6" :answer/id #uuid "dfc34472-7c66-587f-8c25-f275ec9452d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b4c696e-5012-5f5d-8cfd-6336391f1335" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107538/selection/704533e564147e83ceecd0d69d35fa34a74ab05449b2fd45375643ef26b027b6" :answer-field/choices ["q-107538/selection/f73b2dabd2a3493308c1df0303d9039de7c4c3b3dfd412ef871afe24587f2cef" "q-107538/selection/7c59a78bcab05f0345ebbca095f5b0be1f45a6f55c128e4d5a1bb30a12af68ff" "q-107538/selection/2f6bf6798f27657f7aef55909c60f7e59acc90199a1156fcfc38aa621bbfd54e" "q-107538/selection/c77dc21d0b0a32e075674c8f303b541f7a8438473cc3455e0b76637083282f6b" "q-107538/selection/704533e564147e83ceecd0d69d35fa34a74ab05449b2fd45375643ef26b027b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107538" :question/id #uuid "cf0a857f-eb4a-58c2-829d-65dd64e57db8" :question/math-academy-id "q-107538" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-2,{x}_{3}=5,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $2.$ Find $P(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-2$ and ${x}_{3}=5,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =2(x-(-2))(x-(-2))(x-5) \\\\  & =2(x+2)(x+2)(x-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+2)(x+2)(x-5) & =2({x}^{2}+4x+4)(x-5) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-5{x}^{2}+4x-20x-20) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-16x-20) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-32x-40.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-107538/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107538"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "f1b89a3b-2d8d-5de7-85e1-8a77d1284d8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "08cc154c-cb06-5a68-8d1a-7f0da8e823a9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316626/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-316626/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "4d8f0577-f991-5218-9efc-9114f72fabfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d8825049-8f9c-5f2c-b7d5-5208575afe59" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316626/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer-field/choices ["q-316626/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-3/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "2c48b2e8-7314-5080-8d45-fe5f4d23fde6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "5c38b985-1389-54b8-adaf-44b34b9e6d94" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316626/field-3/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer-field/choices ["q-316626/field-3/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-4/f9ce6d2531e925e028befc33f5bb5202bf5c98dc29df5818c58d5bd59c914412" :answer/id #uuid "39623404-05a6-5390-8ec7-19f4b902184a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "90" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "815d2405-11cc-530b-909d-b35eaa7f50f2" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316626/field-4/f9ce6d2531e925e028befc33f5bb5202bf5c98dc29df5818c58d5bd59c914412" :answer-field/choices ["q-316626/field-4/f9ce6d2531e925e028befc33f5bb5202bf5c98dc29df5818c58d5bd59c914412"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316626" :question/id #uuid "46e23247-a138-55b5-8a0b-f43cda1d72d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-316626" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=3,{x}_{3}=-2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $5.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=3,$ ${x}_{2}=3,$ and ${x}_{3}=-2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =5(x-3)(x-3)(x-(-2)) \\\\  & =5(x-3)(x-3)(x+2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(x-3)(x-3)(x+2) & =5({x}^{2}-6x+9)(x+2) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-6{x}^{2}-12x+9x+18) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-3x+18) \\\\  & =5{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}-15x+90.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=5{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}-15x+90.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316626/field-1" "q-316626/field-2" "q-316626/field-3" "q-316626/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316626"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "42bcd0c6-e177-5a0f-85ea-69191d88baa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "d0af8636-e199-5f7e-963a-6d41a50ed82d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "044ee52f-366e-59b0-8a72-1174479473a5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316646/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-316646/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-316646/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "756e601c-d73e-5119-8659-eeddcc739688" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "475afaea-e62c-59e3-85c6-aa749257fd3e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316646/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-316646/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-3/cee37ae0a2921bd3973a5cb0592c822dbbfafcfefba8d7007910ead797b9112f" :answer/id #uuid "fb9082de-24d6-5ed3-83cb-29d8d5a412f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "a20ca450-bba3-56c6-8f45-a00258cd77f3" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316646/field-3/cee37ae0a2921bd3973a5cb0592c822dbbfafcfefba8d7007910ead797b9112f" :answer-field/choices ["q-316646/field-3/cee37ae0a2921bd3973a5cb0592c822dbbfafcfefba8d7007910ead797b9112f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-4/bc787d823ec953ec5e44b8f7f4a4c7f3b5de4a6a5f1cea9c5a660d6b5e6faac7" :answer/id #uuid "a5b4665f-26b1-500e-8eea-78107290637c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "96" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "89f8afbc-60ce-5415-98ba-0207af04e946" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316646/field-4/bc787d823ec953ec5e44b8f7f4a4c7f3b5de4a6a5f1cea9c5a660d6b5e6faac7" :answer-field/choices ["q-316646/field-4/bc787d823ec953ec5e44b8f7f4a4c7f3b5de4a6a5f1cea9c5a660d6b5e6faac7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316646" :question/id #uuid "e84c17cd-0769-5299-a213-2af1da95b80b" :question/math-academy-id "q-316646" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-2,{x}_{2,3}=\\pm 4\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $3.$ Find $f(x).$\n\n$f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,+$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Since $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-2$ and ${x}_{2,3}=\\pm 4\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =3(x-(-2))(x-4\\text{i})(x-(-4\\text{i})) \\\\  & =3(x+2)(x-4\\text{i})(x+4\\text{i})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(x+2)(x-4\\text{i})(x+4\\text{i}) & = \\\\ 3(x+2)({x}^{2}-(4\\text{i})^{2}) & = \\\\ 3(x+2)({x}^{2}+16) & = \\\\ 3({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+16x+32) & = \\\\ 3{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+48x+96 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=3{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+48x+96.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-316646/field-1" "q-316646/field-2" "q-316646/field-3" "q-316646/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4bb90c5-2794-5657-8f0b-45eb64873e03"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316646"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316707/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "dab081ae-c3cb-50ee-ab7f-c0181b635b35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316707/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ebf2970d-a965-5a9a-bb39-97f965d999ec" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316707/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-316707/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316707/field-2/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "b78ff806-5fa0-53b5-a2ae-beae6c10d44e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316707/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "600996a6-d8d3-56da-912f-92023b23a4ef" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316707/field-2/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer-field/choices ["q-316707/field-2/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e